    {
      "name": "Setup Progress",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Three existing setup stages with a tonal selected surface over the landscape.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"Setup progress\" class=\"ds-setup-progress\"><ol><li aria-current=\"step\"><span>01</span> Your account</li><li><span>02</span> Your models</li><li><span>03</span> Your curiosity</li></ol></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-setup-progress{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;color:#bec7be}.ds-setup-progress ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:3px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:4px;border:1px solid #c9dbca26;border-radius:12px;background:#121a16ed}.ds-setup-progress li{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;padding:10px 6px;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px}.ds-setup-progress li span{font-size:9px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-setup-progress li[aria-current]{background:#344032;border-color:#c9dbca26;color:#fff}.ds-setup-progress li[aria-current] span{color:#d8ebe3}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-setup-progress li{font-size:8px;gap:5px;padding:9px 3px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Landscape Controls",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Optional shuffle, pause and credit controls; the artwork plane never captures pointer input.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-scene-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Landscape settings\"><span class=\"ds-scene-caption\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Rainforest falls</span><span class=\"ds-scene-actions\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Change landscape\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 14 4 4-4 4m0-20 4 4-4 4M2 18h2.5a6 6 0 0 0 5-2.7l5-7.6A6 6 0 0 1 19.5 5H22M2 6h2.5a6 6 0 0 1 5 2.7l5 7.6a6 6 0 0 0 5 2.7H22\"/></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Pause landscape animation\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"4\" width=\"4\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1\"/></svg></button><a href=\"https://www.ascii-magic.com/ascii\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Landscape artwork by ASCII Magic (opens in new tab)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6m0-6L10 14\"/><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/></svg></a></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-scene-controls{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;color:#e7ebe3}.ds-scene-caption{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-width:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}.ds-scene-caption i{width:6px;height:6px;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa)}.ds-scene-actions{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-shrink:0}.ds-scene-actions button,.ds-scene-actions a{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;border:1px solid #a6b7a331;border-radius:50%;background:#101713e8;color:#e7ebe3;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,border-color .18s;touch-action:manipulation}.ds-scene-actions button:hover,.ds-scene-actions a:hover{background:#2b382a;border-color:var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa)}.ds-scene-actions :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa);outline-offset:3px}.ds-scene-actions button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-scene-actions button,.ds-scene-actions a{width:40px;height:40px}.ds-scene-caption{font-size:10px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-scene-actions *{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Studio Landscape Header",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "A static poster preview of the supplied rainforest art; the app uses the matching local video when motion is allowed.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-studio-hero\" aria-label=\"Learning studio\"><h1>Your learning studio</h1><p>Explore, practise, and connect what you learn.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-studio-hero{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;min-height:216px;padding:32px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--workspace-edge,#3b3b43);border-radius:17px;color:#f3f5ee;background-color:#080b09;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#0a100ded 0%,#0a100d70 48%,#0a100d0a 80%),linear-gradient(0deg,#0a100dd9,transparent 70%),url(\"/landscapes/rainforest-falls-mist.webp\");background-size:cover;background-position:center 47%}.ds-studio-hero h1{max-width:430px;margin:0;font-size:36px;font-weight:450;line-height:1.17;letter-spacing:-.035em}.ds-studio-hero p{max-width:310px;margin:8px 0 0;color:#d0dacd;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:520px){.ds-studio-hero{padding:22px;min-height:196px}.ds-studio-hero h1{font-size:29px}.ds-studio-hero p{font-size:12px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Landscape Still",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "A static scene thumbnail in navigation, with shuffle as its existing action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-landscape-miniature\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Change landscape. Current scene: Rainforest falls\"><span>Rainforest falls</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 14 4 4-4 4m0-20 4 4-4 4M2 18h2.5a6 6 0 0 0 5-2.7l5-7.6A6 6 0 0 1 19.5 5H22M2 6h2.5a6 6 0 0 1 5 2.7l5 7.6a6 6 0 0 0 5 2.7H22\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-landscape-miniature{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;width:100%;height:93px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--workspace-edge,#3b3b43);border-radius:12px;color:#f3f5ee;background-color:#101713;background-image:linear-gradient(0deg,#101713ee,transparent),url(\"/landscapes/rainforest-falls-mist.webp\");background-size:cover;background-position:center 54%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .18s}.ds-landscape-miniature span{min-width:0;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}.ds-landscape-miniature svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-landscape-miniature:hover{border-color:var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa)}.ds-landscape-miniature:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Unified Composer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "The quiet shared writing surface retains its controls and editor ownership; the focus border follows the scene.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer\"><textarea aria-label=\"Learning topic\" placeholder=\"What do you want to learn?\"></textarea><div class=\"ds-composer-toolbar\"><button class=\"ds-attach\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Attach files\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 11-9 9a6 6 0 0 1-8.5-8.5L13 2a4 4 0 0 1 5.5 5.5L9 17a2 2 0 0 1-2.8-2.8l8.5-8.5\"/></svg></button><span class=\"ds-mode-controls\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Teach</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Practice</button></span><button class=\"ds-send\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Start session\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7m-7-7v14\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;padding:20px 16px 12px;border:1px solid var(--workspace-edge,#3b3b43);border-radius:20px;background:var(--composer-fill,color-mix(in srgb,var(--background,#1a1a1e) 28%,#000));color:var(--foreground,#f2f1f5);box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0000001c}.ds-composer:focus-within{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa) 65%,var(--border,#3b3b43))}.ds-composer textarea{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;display:block;width:calc(100% - 14px);min-height:110px;padding:2px 7px 8px;resize:vertical;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.ds-composer textarea::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground,#b0adbd)}.ds-composer textarea:focus-visible{outline:none}.ds-composer-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:38px}.ds-composer-toolbar button{font-family:lh-interface,Inter,sans-serif;border:0;color:inherit;background:transparent;cursor:pointer}.ds-composer-toolbar button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--landscape-accent,#b8d5aa);outline-offset:3px}.ds-composer-toolbar button:hover{background:var(--accent,#303034)}.ds-composer-toolbar .ds-attach{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;padding:0;border-radius:50%;color:var(--muted-foreground,#b0adbd)}.ds-mode-controls{display:flex;gap:2px}.ds-mode-controls button{padding:8px 11px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px}.ds-mode-controls button[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--accent,#303034)}.ds-composer-toolbar .ds-send{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;margin-left:auto;padding:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--foreground,#f2f1f5);color:var(--background,#1a1a1e)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Keep the learning in focus.",
    "overview": "Cognera opens onto the user's five supplied ASCII Magic halftone landscapes. Their colored dots carry the visual personality, while account forms, the learning desk, and the knowledge atlas retain their familiar copy and behavior. One continuous landscape plane crosses the two onboarding cards; the main workspace gives the landscape a wide header and a small still in navigation.\n\nFloating monochrome navigation and an inset workspace frame the actual learning content. Home keeps the working desk on the left and the real knowledge atlas beside it, stacking them in narrow containers. Conversations retain a continuous reading canvas with neutral learner bubbles and unboxed assistant replies.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Supplied halftone landscapes with scene-derived accents.",
      "One continuous onboarding video beneath two equal desktop cards.",
      "Quiet, theme-aware learning surfaces and a unified composer.",
      "Readable forms, optional landscape controls, and still-image fallbacks."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Readable Foreground Rule",
        "body": "Keep text and controls above localized dark scrims; landscape pixels must not become a filter over forms or learning records.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use actual learning records and truthful empty states.",
      "Do preserve user themes, configured emphasis, reading preferences, keyboard shortcuts, and plugin contracts.",
      "Do use the five supplied landscape exports and their local derivatives; retain the provenance in `public/landscapes/SOURCES.md`.",
      "Do keep forms legible above the shared landscape and preserve all existing copy and product flows.",
      "Do verify menus, expanded questions, long text, and narrow or short layouts in the rendered application."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace accessible focus with visual subtlety.",
      "Don't replace supplied artwork with generated substitutes, decorative stock scenes, or remote embeds.",
      "Don't add landscape motion to the reading canvas or use it to obscure learning records."
    ]
  }
}
